{"seq":3,"slug":"custom-validation-engines","title":"自定义校验引擎设计与构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/frameworks-tools/custom-validation-engines","wordCount":1103,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"自定义校验引擎设计与构建\">自定义校验引擎设计与构建</h1><p>当业务规则的复杂度超出 GX 和 Soda 的声明式模型能力范围时——例如需要跨多表的时序关联校验、基于机器学习的异常检测、或特定领域的语义验证——自定义校验引擎成为必要选择。本文探讨如何设计一个可扩展、可测试、可运维的校验引擎架构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自定义校验引擎的设计原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三层分离</strong>：规则定义、执行逻辑、结果处理彻底解耦，各层独立演化和测试</li>\n<li><strong>声明式 DSL</strong>：通过领域特定语言让业务规则可以被非引擎开发者定义和维护</li>\n<li><strong>执行优化</strong>：批次合并、并行调度、增量执行等策略控制大规模规则集的性能开销</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"何时需要自定义引擎\">何时需要自定义引擎</h2><p>在伸手构建自定义方案之前，先确认标准工具确实无法满足需求：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>GX/Soda 能否覆盖</th>\n<th>需自定义的原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单列 NULL/范围/格式</td>\n<td>完全覆盖</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨列简单关系</td>\n<td>基本覆盖</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨表引用完整性</td>\n<td>覆盖</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时序窗口内的趋势判断</td>\n<td>部分覆盖</td>\n<td>窗口逻辑复杂时受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ML 模型输出的合理性校验</td>\n<td>不覆盖</td>\n<td>需要加载模型推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>领域特定语义（如医学编码合法性）</td>\n<td>不覆盖</td>\n<td>需要领域知识库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨系统事务一致性</td>\n<td>不覆盖</td>\n<td>需要联合查询多源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然语言字段的质量评估</td>\n<td>不覆盖</td>\n<td>需要 NLP 处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"引擎架构-规则-执行-结果三层分离\">引擎架构：规则-执行-结果三层分离</h2><p>可扩展的校验引擎应将&quot;规则定义&quot;、&quot;执行逻辑&quot;和&quot;结果处理&quot;彻底分离：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 规则层&#10;        R1[规则定义 YAML/JSON]&#10;        R2[规则注册表]&#10;        R1 --&gt; R2&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 执行层&#10;        E1[规则编译器]&#10;        E2[执行调度器]&#10;        E3[数据访问层]&#10;        R2 --&gt; E1&#10;        E1 --&gt; E2&#10;        E3 --&gt; E2&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 结果层&#10;        O1[结果聚合器]&#10;        O2[告警路由]&#10;        O3[结果存储]&#10;        E2 --&gt; O1&#10;        O1 --&gt; O2&#10;        O1 --&gt; O3&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 规则层\n        R1[规则定义 YAML/JSON]\n        R2[规则注册表]\n        R1 --&gt; R2\n    end\n    subgraph 执行层\n        E1[规则编译器]\n        E2[执行调度器]\n        E3[数据访问层]\n        R2 --&gt; E1\n        E1 --&gt; E2\n        E3 --&gt; E2\n    end\n    subgraph 结果层\n        O1[结果聚合器]\n        O2[告警路由]\n        O3[结果存储]\n        E2 --&gt; O1\n        O1 --&gt; O2\n        O1 --&gt; O3\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"规则定义-dsl-设计\">规则定义 DSL 设计</h2><p>一个好的规则 DSL（Domain-Specific Language）应该让数据工程师能快速定义规则而无需理解底层执行细节。设计原则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>声明式</strong>：描述&quot;期望什么&quot;而非&quot;如何检查&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>可组合</strong>：基础规则可以通过逻辑运算组合成复杂规则</li>\n<li><strong>可参数化</strong>：同一规则模板可以通过参数适配不同列/表</li>\n<li><strong>自文档化</strong>：规则定义本身就是规格说明</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# rules/order_consistency.yml&#10;rule: order_total_matches_line_items&#10;version: 2&#10;severity: critical&#10;description: &#39;订单总金额应等于行项目金额之和&#39;&#10;&#10;source:&#10;  type: sql&#10;  query: |&#10;    SELECT&#10;      o.order_id,&#10;      o.total_amount,&#10;      COALESCE(SUM(li.amount * li.quantity), 0) AS computed_total&#10;    FROM orders o&#10;    LEFT JOIN line_items li ON li.order_id = o.order_id&#10;    WHERE o.created_at &gt;= :check_start&#10;    GROUP BY o.order_id, o.total_amount&#10;&#10;assertion:&#10;  type: column_comparison&#10;  condition: &#39;abs(total_amount - computed_total) &lt; 0.01&#39;&#10;&#10;failure_handling:&#10;  action: quarantine&#10;  metadata:&#10;    - order_id&#10;    - total_amount&#10;    - computed_total&#10;    - abs(total_amount - computed_total) AS delta\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># rules/order_consistency.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order_total_matches_line_items</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'订单总金额应等于行项目金额之和'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">sql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      o.order_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      o.total_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      COALESCE(SUM(li.amount * li.quantity), 0) AS computed_total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    LEFT JOIN line_items li ON li.order_id = o.order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE o.created_at >= :check_start</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    GROUP BY o.order_id, o.total_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">assertion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">column_comparison</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'abs(total_amount - computed_total) &#x3C; 0.01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">failure_handling</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">quarantine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">total_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">computed_total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">abs(total_amount - computed_total) AS delta</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"python-实现-规则引擎核心\">Python 实现：规则引擎核心</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from dataclasses import dataclass&#10;from enum import Enum&#10;from typing import Protocol&#10;&#10;class Severity(Enum):&#10;    CRITICAL = &quot;critical&quot;&#10;    HIGH = &quot;high&quot;&#10;    MEDIUM = &quot;medium&quot;&#10;    LOW = &quot;low&quot;&#10;&#10;@dataclass(frozen=True)&#10;class CheckResult:&#10;    rule_id: str&#10;    passed: bool&#10;    total_records: int&#10;    failed_records: int&#10;    failed_samples: list[dict]&#10;    severity: Severity&#10;    execution_time_ms: float&#10;&#10;class Rule(Protocol):&#10;    @property&#10;    def rule_id(self) -&gt; str: ...&#10;    @property&#10;    def severity(self) -&gt; Severity: ...&#10;    def execute(self, connection) -&gt; CheckResult: ...&#10;&#10;class SQLRule:&#10;    def __init__(self, config: dict):&#10;        self._id = config[&quot;rule&quot;]&#10;        self._severity = Severity(config[&quot;severity&quot;])&#10;        self._query = config[&quot;source&quot;][&quot;query&quot;]&#10;        self._condition = config[&quot;assertion&quot;][&quot;condition&quot;]&#10;&#10;    @property&#10;    def rule_id(self) -&gt; str:&#10;        return self._id&#10;&#10;    @property&#10;    def severity(self) -&gt; Severity:&#10;        return self._severity&#10;&#10;    def execute(self, connection) -&gt; CheckResult:&#10;        import time&#10;        start = time.monotonic()&#10;        rows = connection.execute(self._query).fetchall()&#10;        failed = [r for r in rows if not self._evaluate(r)]&#10;        elapsed = (time.monotonic() - start) * 1000&#10;        return CheckResult(&#10;            rule_id=self._id,&#10;            passed=len(failed) == 0,&#10;            total_records=len(rows),&#10;            failed_records=len(failed),&#10;            failed_samples=failed[:10],&#10;            severity=self._severity,&#10;            execution_time_ms=elapsed,&#10;        )\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclasses </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> enum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Enum</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Protocol</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Enum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    CRITICAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"critical\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    HIGH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"high\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    MEDIUM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"medium\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    LOW</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"low\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dataclass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">frozen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CheckResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rule_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    passed: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total_records: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    failed_records: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    failed_samples: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    severity: Severity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    execution_time_ms: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">property</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rule_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">property</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> Severity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, connection) -> CheckResult: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SQLRule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, config: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._severity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Severity(config[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"severity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._query </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-da