 style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._severity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, connection) -> CheckResult:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.monotonic()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        rows </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> connection.execute(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._query).fetchall()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        failed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rows </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._evaluate(r)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (time.monotonic() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CheckResult(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            rule_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            passed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(failed) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            total_records</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rows),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            failed_records</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(failed),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            failed_samples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">failed[:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            severity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._severity,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            execution_time_ms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">elapsed,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"执行调度策略\">执行调度策略</h2><p>规则的执行顺序和并发策略直接影响整体性能和资源消耗：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>串行执行</td>\n<td>规则间有依赖、共享事务</td>\n<td>单线程顺序执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行执行</td>\n<td>独立规则、不同数据源</td>\n<td>线程池/异步 IO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批次合并</td>\n<td>多规则查询同一表</td>\n<td>SQL 合并为一条查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样执行</td>\n<td>大表上的探索性检查</td>\n<td><code>TABLESAMPLE</code> 或 <code>LIMIT</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量执行</td>\n<td>分区表的增量加载</td>\n<td>只校验新到达的分区</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>批次合并优化</strong>：当多条规则都需要扫描同一张表时，将它们合并为一条 SQL 可以显著减少 I/O：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;  COUNT(*) AS total_rows,&#10;  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE order_id IS NULL) AS null_order_id,&#10;  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE amount &lt; 0) AS negative_amount,&#10;  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE status NOT IN (&#39;pending&#39;,&#39;shipped&#39;,&#39;delivered&#39;)) AS invalid_status,&#10;  MAX(created_at) AS max_timestamp&#10;FROM orders&#10;WHERE created_at &gt;= &#39;2026-07-01&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_rows,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> null_order_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> negative_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'shipped'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'delivered'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> invalid_status,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(created_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_timestamp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-07-01'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一次表扫描同时评估了完整性、有效性和时效性三个维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试校验引擎本身\">测试校验引擎本身</h2><p>校验引擎是关键基础设施，它本身需要被充分测试。策略包括：</p>\n<p><strong>已知数据测试</strong>：构造包含已知缺陷的测试数据集，验证引擎能正确检测到每种缺陷类型。</p>\n<p><strong>回归测试</strong>：当修改规则或引擎逻辑后，在历史数据上重新执行并比对结果，确保没有引入新的误报/漏报。</p>\n<p><strong>性能基准</strong>：对典型规模的数据集执行全套规则，记录执行时间并设置退化告警。</p>\n<p>这些测试应纳入 CI/CD 流程——参见 <a href=\"../pipeline-integration/ci-cd-data-testing\">CI/CD 中的数据测试</a> 了解如何将质量检查本身的测试集成到持续集成管道中。引擎执行结果的消费侧，包括告警路由和 SLA 追踪，见 <a href=\"../operations/data-sla-alerting\">数据 SLA 与告警</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>自定义校验引擎是标准框架能力边界之外的补充方案：当业务规则涉及跨系统事务一致性、ML 输出合理性、领域语义验证等场景时才有必要构建。核心设计是规则-执行-结果三层分离，配合声明式 DSL 降低使用门槛、批次合并等策略控制性能。引擎本身的正确性也需要通过已知数据测试来保障。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自定义校验引擎设计与构建","id":"自定义校验引擎设计与构建"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"何时需要自定义引擎","id":"何时需要自定义引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"引擎架构：规则-执行-结果三层分离","id":"引擎架构-规则-执行-结果三层分离"},{"level":2,"text":"规则定义 DSL 设计","id":"规则定义-dsl-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"Python 实现：规则引擎核心","id":"python-实现-规则引擎核心"},{"level":2,"text":"执行调度策略","id":"执行调度策略"},{"level":2,"text":"测试校验引擎本身","id":"测试校验引擎本身"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Soda 与 dbt 数据测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/frameworks-tools/soda-dbt-tests"},"next":{"title":"CI/CD 中的数据测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/pipeline-integration/ci-cd-data-testing"}}